\par }{\fs24 \tab }{\b\fs24\cf6 Protection from Acid:}{\fs24\cf6  }{\fs24 (Reading time\emdash 6) The reader is protected from all forms of acid, to a maximum damage of 20 Hit Dice or a maximum duration of 1d4+8 turns, whichever occurs first.
\par 
