poison gas, gaseous breath weapons, spells that generate gas (such as }{\i\fs24 stinking cloud}{\fs24  and }{\i\fs24 cloudkill}{\fs24 ), and all similar forms of noxious, toxic vapors. The protection lasts for 1d4+4 rounds.
