\par Bean #3\tab A poisonous raspberry bush with animated runners shoots up, but each of 
\par \tab its 5d4 berries is a gem of 100 or 500 gp base value (or perhaps just 
\par \tab worthless glass)
\par Bean #4\tab A hole opens in the ground; a purple worm or a }{\i\fs24 djinni ring}{\fs24  can be below
\par Bean #5\tab Smoke and gas cover an area of 50-foot radius for five turns; creatures in 
\par \tab the smoke cloud can't see and will be blinded for 1d6 rounds when they step 
\par \tab out of the cloud.
\par Bean #6\tab A wyvern grows instantly and attacks; its sting is a }{\i\fs24 javelin of piercing}{\fs24 
\par Bean #7\tab Poison gas seeps out slowly, forming a cloud of 20-foot radius that 
\par \tab persists for one turn; while it lasts it might turn some dirt at its center to 
\par \tab magical dust (}{\i\fs24 appearance, vanishing, sneezing and choking}{\fs24 )
\par }\pard \nowidctlpar\tx-720\tx240\tx480\adjustright {\fs24 
\par }\pard\plain \s15\nowidctlpar\tx-720\tx240\tx480\adjustright {\tab Thought, imagination, and judgment on the part of the DM are required with this item.
